<title>USA: Dime Community Bancorp names Devine president.</title>
<headline>Dime Community Bancorp names Devine president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dime Community Bancorp Inc said it named Michael Devine as president, replacing Vincent Palagiano, who remains chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Devine will remain as the company's chief operating officer. He will assume the president's post on January 1.</p>
<p>Devine has been with Dime since 1971. Before joining, he worked for Peat Marwick Mitchell &amp; Co, the company said.</p>
